        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibore ŋini emaikina ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi toryamut",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyeryamunete ŋisacaradotin ŋulu erae ŋilepi ŋulu arae ŋituŋa a Lepi daadaŋ akwap ŋina eruwor ŋina kec anakwap a Ŋisirael. Epedorete ikes akinyam ŋamuronisya ka ŋainakineta ŋuna etyakakinitae Ekapolon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nai nyeryamunete ikes akwap ŋina eruwor ŋina kec lopite ŋolo eryamuniata Ŋisirael ŋuluce; Ekapolon iŋes erae akorakinet kec, lopite ŋolo eikinitor Ekapolon ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋisacaradotin toryamut aneni a ŋituŋa a ŋulu eyaunete amuronot ŋina ke emoŋ, kori a emesek ŋinerin lu: Eseket, ŋiŋitiny ka aboi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eryamunete ŋisacaradotin aneni a ŋituŋa ŋikinyom ŋulu eŋarenok, epiini ŋolo a ekiŋaren, akimyet ŋina a ekiŋaren ka ŋajul a ŋamesekin ŋuna etubunio ekiŋaren. Emaikina ŋituŋa inakis ikes ŋiboro ŋul; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae abu Ekapolon Akuj kus toseu ŋituŋa a ekabila a Lepi alotuŋa a ŋikabilae a Ŋisirael daadaŋ akiwo ka akitiya alokiro ke Ekapolon, iŋes kaapei ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kimyek Elepait etaun kus edio neni sek iboiyo iŋes alo Isirael, todolu nakibois ŋina eseuni Ekapolon (epedori iŋes abunore nen apaki daadaŋ ŋina ecamitor), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "epedori iŋes akitiya alokiro ke Ekapolon Akuj keŋ, lopite ŋolo itiyaata ŋikaitotoi keŋ, ŋilepi ŋuluce, ŋulu ewuasi akitiya anakibois a ŋin alokiŋaren Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ikes toryamut akimuj ŋina enyamete ŋina eriyan ka ŋina eryamunete ŋilepi ŋuluce, tari daŋ keryamununeete ikes ŋiboro ŋice aneni a ŋituŋa a ŋikalya kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eŋeritoe akiar ŋidwe erae ŋamuronisya ka ŋimurok ta ŋikekukujak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani idolete iyes nakwap ŋina ikiinit Ekapolon Akuj kus iyes, tocoito nyisisaut ŋiticisyo ŋulu aronok ŋulu eŋeritoe ŋulu itiyaete ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyeryamun alokidiŋ kus ituŋanan ŋini eari lokoku keŋ, kori nakoku keŋ erae amuronot ŋina epeyo, kori nyeyakaun kidiŋ kus ŋimurok, ŋikadwarak ŋakiro, kori ŋikelamak, kori ŋikekukujak, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kori ŋikecenok, kori ŋulu irworosi ka ŋililae, kori ŋulu iwarito aryamun ŋakiro aneni a ŋikatwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋerit Ekapolon ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini itiyae ŋakiro ŋun. Erae aŋuna etiyaata ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin ŋuna eŋerit Ekapolon, iŋes eritarya Ekapolon ikes alokiŋaren kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes torubakis iwuapito ŋuna a Ekapolon Akuj kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari kiwuapito ŋituŋa ŋulu ilosete iyes akiritar anakwapin kec ŋakiro a ŋikadwarak ŋakiro ka ŋuna a ŋimurok, nai iyes, nyecamit Ekapolon Akuj kus iyes itiyaete ŋakiro ŋun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekadwaran ece ŋolokitete ŋolo ikwaan ka Moses",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebuni Ekapolon Akuj kus aseun aŋuna kus alotuŋa kus ekadwaran ece ŋolo ikikwaan ka ayoŋ, emaikina iyes kiwuapa ŋakiro a ekadwaran a ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro nu ikes ipotu iyes kiŋita Ekapolon Akuj kus akoloŋit ŋina iponiata iyes tocunakin alomoru Oreb, ŋina ibaakatar iyes, “Ani kikiira nabo iwon etoil ka Akuj a Ekapolon yok, kori kikiŋolik nabo akim ŋina apolon na, ikitwaki iwon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon okoboŋok ayoŋ tema, “Iyookinito ikes anakiro aŋuna irworosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseuni ayoŋ alokidiŋ kec ka aŋuna kec ekadwaran ŋolo ikwaan ka iyoŋ; alimokini ayoŋ ekadwaran ŋol ŋakiro kaŋ ka ebuni iŋes alimokin ikes ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna alimokini ayoŋ iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini nyiwuapi ŋakiro ŋuna elimuni ekadwaran alokiro kaŋ, ayoŋ elope esicani iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ekadwaran ŋolo irworo alokiro a ŋakujo, kori ŋolo elimuni alokiro kaŋ ŋakiro ŋuna pa alimokinit ayoŋ iŋes akirwor, emaikina ekadwaran ŋol totwan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acepaki itemarete iyes neni kus make, “Ikiyenuni isua ikwaani akirot ŋina nyelimunit Ekapolon?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kirwor ekadwaran alokiro ke Ekapolon nai nyitiyakin, kori nyiyookin ŋuna alimunit iŋes, iŋes atemar nyelimunit Ekapolon akirot ŋin; irworo ekadwaran ŋol ŋakiro ŋuna pa alimokinit ayoŋ iŋes, nyikibul aŋuna a ŋakiro keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
